tests:
The new adv section covers:
- the pillion fall no longer leads to driving the Chetak;
- a fallen Chetak is picked up but not ridden;
- a Hero 14 u away beats a Chetak 4 u away;
- refusals sit at priority -2 and 6 E presses give 1 refusal;
- no lift from a bike passing at 70 u/s, and 'no room' when it carries a pillion;
- a pursuit Chetak offers nothing;
- a despawned bus sets its passenger down;
- a locked ride is released when its mission ends;
- the ticket punch gives a free bus;
- Escape on the fare card keeps it shut and ACTION reopens it;
- potholes: no tunnelling (r 1.3 at 112 u/s), front hit plus rear follow-through with one penalty (auto at 70, Hero at 45), one fall per 45 s, junk data is NaN-safe;
- 3D tps view applies the same rules;
- touch-stick handling for the Scooty and the Hero;
- save/load in a debug Ambassador or riding a bus leaves him on foot with no stray copy.
